{"articleNo":"146604","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=146604&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016학년도 1학기 국가장학금 신청자 확인사항(편입생)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.26","hit":"4070","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016학년도 1학기 국가장학금 신청자 확인사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016학년도 1학기 국가장학금 1차 신청자 중 아래에 해당하는 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">2016. 3. 4(금)까지 </font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">학생처로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">바로 연락바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 해당자 : 국가장학금 신청자 중 신청당시 금오공과대학교가 아닌</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"></span></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">타대학소속으로 신청한 학생</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ 타대학소속으로 신청한 학생 중 학생처로 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">미리 연락을 준 학생들은</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">별도 연락 필요없음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 사유 : 타대학소속으로 신청한 경우 신청자로 확인이 불가하여 국가장학생으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">선발될 수 없으므로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">한국장학재단에 학생명단을 별도로 요청해야함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 학생처 : 054-478-7065</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>** 국가장학생 신청자 추가선발확인 및 장학금지급은 한국장학재단에서 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>일정통보시 공지예정임</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">금오공대 학생처</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016.&nbsp; 2. 26.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
